Subject: sum-to-one constraint on fixed effects coefs
Message-ID: <NCoFmfckbUo.u6u6eCswBwAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/NCoFmfckbUo/m/u6u6eCswBwAJ>
